          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "你好，我是初音未来，可以叫我Miku。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26015002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "你看起来有些消沉，是遇到什么困难了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26015005",
              "text": "是的，不太顺利。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "26015005",
              "text": "还好，只是有些累。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26015003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26015004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "如果感到失落，就躲进我的歌声里吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26015005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯！听完Miku的演唱，再次感觉活力满满了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
